aph from Shasho Kelbesa's website gallery.</p>\n      <a class=\"plant-enquiry\" href=\"@@ADMAKI_17@@\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Enquire about the cleaning plant <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12h16m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"services\" aria-labelledby=\"services-title\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><small>03 / OUR BUSINESS</small><h2 id=\"services-title\">WHAT WE DO</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"service-grid\"><article class=\"service export\"><div class=\"service-top\"><span class=\"service-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 21v-9M12 12C7 13 4 10 4 5c5-1 8 2 8 7Zm0 0c5 1 8-2 8-7-5-1-8 2-8 7Z\"></path></svg></span><span>01</span></div><h3>Agricultural<br>Exports</h3><p>Niger seeds, sesame seeds, other oilseeds and cereals.</p><div class=\"tags\"><span>Niger seeds</span><span>Sesame</span><span>Cereals</span></div><a href=\"https://shashokelbesa.com/export/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Explore exports <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"></path></svg></a></article>\n      <article class=\"service import\"><div class=\"service-top\"><span class=\"service-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 5h12v12H3zM15 9h4l3 4v4h-7\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><span>02</span></div><h3>Imports &amp;<br>Equipment</h3><p>Excavators, wheel loaders, trucks, automobiles, tyres and paper products.</p><div class=\"tags\"><span>Machinery</span><span>Vehicles</span><span>Tyres</span></div><a href=\"https://shashokelbesa.com/import/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Explore imports <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"></path></svg></a></article></div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"office-section\" aria-labelledby=\"office-title\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><small>04 / LOCATION</small><h2 id=\"office-title\">VISIT OUR OFFICE</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"office-card\"><div class=\"map-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pin-symbol\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12S4 16 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"></circle></svg></div></div><div class=\"office-copy\"><small>ADDIS ABABA · ETHIOPIA</small><h3>@@ADMAKI_9@@</h3><address>@@ADMAKI_8@@</address></div><a class=\"directions\" href=\"@@ADMAKI_22@@\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Find our office on Google Maps <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12h16m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div>\n      <p class=\"map-note\">Map link uses the published address, not a verified exact pin. The processing plant's location has not been confirmed.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"social-section\" aria-labelledby=\"social-title\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><small>05 / SOCIAL MEDIA</small><h2 id=\"social-title\">Connect online</h2></div><nav class=\"social-row\" aria-label=\"Official company social media\">@@ADMAKI_0@@</nav></section>\n    <section class=\"closi